@startuml module-context
title Coding Agent Module Context
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

' Source evidence baseline: CampusClaw commit d649866a6cae967ace18ceaeb9597edd47e5721e.
' Source: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/CampusClawApplication.java, CampusClawApplication#main.
' Source: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/web/RuntimeEventController.java.
' Observed behavior: the baseline process supported a Spring MVC service and an explicit CLI subcommand.
' Architecture change: the target process exposes only the Spring MVC managed Agent service.
